flowchart LR
    A[Agent Output] --> B{Structured?}
    B -->|No| C[Require schema]
    B -->|Yes| D[Check citations]
    D --> E{Evidence?}
    E -->|No| F[Flag missing evidence]
    E -->|Yes| G[Run test / verify]
    G --> H{Passes?}
    H -->|No| I[Reject / revise]
    H -->|Yes| J[Accept with note]
    F --> K[Escalate to human]
    I --> L[Iterate prompt]
    L --> A

    style A fill:#3b82f6,stroke:#60a5fa,color:#fff
    style E fill:#f59e0b,stroke:#fbbf24,color:#000
    style H fill:#22c55e,stroke:#86efac,color:#000
    style K fill:#ef4444,stroke:#fca5a5,color:#000
